{"title": "Slay the Wicked", "pageid": 27987, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Slay_the_Wicked", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Slay the Wicked</b> is a passive feature that increases damage against Fiends and Undead.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>This weapon deals an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slashing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">Slashing</span></a> damage against <a href=\"/wiki/Fiend\" title=\"Fiend\">Fiends</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Undead\" title=\"Undead\">Undead</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Undead_Bane\" title=\"The Undead Bane\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Greataxe_B_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Greataxe_B_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Greataxe_B_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Greataxe_B_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Greataxe_B_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Greataxe_B_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Greataxe_B_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Greataxe_B_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Greataxe_B_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Undead_Bane\" title=\"The Undead Bane\">The Undead Bane</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ulma\" title=\"Ulma\">Ulma</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Slay the Wicked is applied to all melee weapon attacks while having the source weapon equipped.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Due to the way the bonus damage is applied to attacks against Fiends and Undead, the bonus damage can never critically hit even if the attack itself does.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202031\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1141/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 10115/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3316/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/7